### Countries (brief, user stories 1 and 2). Runs in IntelliJ or VS Code REST Client.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### First page, sorted by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/countries

### Europe, most populous first, five per page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/countries?region=europe&sort=population&direction=desc&page=0&size=5

### Second page of ten
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/countries?page=1&size=10

### Invalid page size: 400 problem detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/countries?size=0

### One country
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/countries/SWE

### Unknown country: 404 problem detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/countries/XYZ
